Subject: [PATCH] python-flask-httpauth: use correct wheel name

Fixes:

```
FileNotFoundError: [Errno 2] No such file or directory: '~/build/build_dir/target-arm_cortex-a9+vfpv3-d16_musl_eabi/pypi/Flask-HTTPAuth-4.8.0//openwrt-build/Flask_HTTPAuth-4.8.0-*.whl'
